  "limits": "This group proves the stated oriented Gauss geometry and deletion assembly on one interval. It is not yet an assembly of every clause of lem:soft-generic: full inherited point/parameter convergence and determinant signs, all turn/direction conclusions, newborn point limit and a same-chamber assertion are not bundled into this statement. The theorem exports exact physical successors and vertex evaluations rather than explicit traversalBetween witnesses for those vertex coordinates. It does not prove the amplitude or corner soft laws. Same-model technical review and existing root kernel evidence do not grant stronger fidelity/source acceptance or controlled canonical integration."
